    "This is a provisional browser assessment based on the attached sheets and supplied runtime narrative; no independent runtime actions or file inspection were performed.",
    "Scores use the frozen six dimensions; A is the normalized mean of hierarchy, typography and surfaces, F of clarity, feedback and accessibility, and overall is round(0.4A + 0.6F, 1).",
    "The authorized A>=9 and F>=9 threshold is not met across all screens or components; strong individual scores do not erase the birth-details feedback and large-text discoverability issues.",
    "A 9 here applies only to the demonstrated browser dimension and is not full/native certification; no 10 is supported by the supplied evidence.",
    "The supplied runtime reports layout, target-size, contrast, motion, persistence and interaction checks; these reports were considered as evidence without treating screenshots themselves as proof of behavior.",
    "Cropped content in a scrolled screenshot is not proof of unreachable content; reported layout checks prevent treating every viewport boundary as an accessibility failure.",
    "No hard-gate task failure or actual data loss is established; the stale calculation message after forgetting is a feedback defect, while supplied runtime reports that removal succeeds.",
    "Static transition captures show visual consistency but cannot independently establish animation timing, focus continuity or absence of transient layout shifts.",
    "Synthetic long answers, source descriptions, forecasts and fixture-prefixed errors are layout evidence, not production-copy or model-quality evidence; apparent mid-word endings require a preservation check rather than an unsupported data-loss claim.",
    "Current sheets do not directly show successful microphone capture, populated other-answer submission, monthly-selected plans, connected Circles or export preparation/failure states.",
    "Physical iPhone Safari, native Dynamic Type, VoiceOver, microphone, haptics, actual payments and OS share delivery remain unverified; no novice-use study is supplied.",
